{"id":"5e7476d444d4ade0","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-prop-euler-char.md","title":"Euler Characteristic","display":"prop-euler-char — Euler Characteristic","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-euler-char","aliases":["58-prop-euler-char"],"display":"prop-euler-char — Euler Characteristic","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-euler-char"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-euler-char</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-euler-char — Euler Characteristic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3a061d5c71f82e51\" href=\"?note=3a061d5c71f82e51\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md\">../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,V,n,\\chi\\in V\">\\(K,V,n,\\chi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V)\">\\(\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3a061d5c71f82e51\" href=\"?note=3a061d5c71f82e51\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md\">../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(K)\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}(K)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EulerCharacteristic}_S(\\chi,K,V,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{EulerCharacteristic}_S(\\chi,K,V,n)\\)</span>（本文件定义的有限单纯复形 Euler 示性数关系）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}euler-char} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{EulerCharacteristic}_S(\\chi,K,V,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V)\\land\n\\mathrm{Finite}(K)\\land\n\\chi\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\n\\Bigl[\n(K=\\varnothing\\land n=-1\\land\\chi=0)\\lor\n\\bigl(K\\neq\\varnothing\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\dim K=n\\land\n\\chi=\\sum_{i=0}^n(-1)^i\\left|\\{\\sigma\\in K\\mid|\\sigma|=i+1\\}\\right|\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}euler-char} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{EulerCharacteristic}_S(\\chi,K,V,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V)\\land\n\\mathrm{Finite}(K)\\land\n\\chi\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\n\\Bigl[\n(K=\\varnothing\\land n=-1\\land\\chi=0)\\lor\n\\bigl(K\\neq\\varnothing\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\dim K=n\\land\n\\chi=\\sum_{i=0}^n(-1)^i\\left|\\{\\sigma\\in K\\mid|\\sigma|=i+1\\}\\right|\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|K|\">\\(|K|\\)</span> in the upstream atom denotes geometric realization, not cardinality; finiteness is therefore stated with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(K)\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}(K)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Topological invariance of the resulting integer is a separate theorem about finite triangulations.</li>\n<li>The empty complex follows the upstream convention <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim\\varnothing=-1\">\\(\\dim\\varnothing=-1\\)</span> and has Euler characteristic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>. 对有限二维单纯复形，该式化为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi=V-E+F\">\\(\\chi=V-E+F\\)</span>；高维情形必须保留全部维数的交错和。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"3a061d5c71f82e51","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"3a061d5c71f82e51","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V)$（see [[../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}(K)$（see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,V,n,\\chi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}(K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EulerCharacteristic}_S(\\chi,K,V,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}euler-char} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{EulerCharacteristic}_S(\\chi,K,V,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V)\\land\n\\mathrm{Finite}(K)\\land\n\\chi\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\n\\Bigl[\n(K=\\varnothing\\land n=-1\\land\\chi=0)\\lor\n\\bigl(K\\neq\\varnothing\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\dim K=n\\land\n\\chi=\\sum_{i=0}^n(-1)^i\\left|\\{\\sigma\\in K\\mid|\\sigma|=i+1\\}\\right|\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"|K|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}(K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\dim\\varnothing=-1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi=V-E+F","display":false}],"bytes":1532,"backlinks":[{"id":"b80ea50ccf56b0ca","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e4a27d7be1b49de0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3956","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-prop-euler-char.md|58-prop-euler-char]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["3a061d5c71f82e51","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}